OL,3,GNEWSAAll you need to know about Light
OL,4,ANight Leeds 2026 tonight
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeeds will be illuminated with light
OL,7,Fprojections, installations and
OL,8,Fperformances tonight and tomorrow, as
OL,9,Fthe annual Light Night takes place.
OL,11,FLight Night is one of the UK's largest
OL,12,Flight festivals, and sees landmark
OL,13,Fbuildings lit up across two evenings.
OL,15,FThousands of people are expected to
OL,16,Fvisit the city for the event, which
OL,17,Fwill feature more than 40 artworks by
OL,18,Fartists working in Leeds, the UK and
OL,19,Finternationally.
OL,21,FHere's everything you need to know
OL,22,Fabout what to expect.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
